      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    ana = 550\n    prior_19_day_ema = 528\n    prior_39_day_ema = 530\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    ema_19_day = (ana * 0.10) + (prior_19_day_ema * 0.90)\n    ema_39_day = (ana * 0.05) + (prior_39_day_ema * 0.95)\n    adjusted_mcclellan_oscillator = ema_19_day - ema_39_day\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to two decimal places\n    return round(adjusted_mcclellan_oscillator, 2)\n```",
